-- re-make this, not this. Run in Studio (Edit, execute_luau) on the place with World2,
-- after tools/world2_terrain.luau and tools/world2_meadow.luau. Re-running is fine.
-- Yellow grass, darker yellow grass and brown dirt as a gradient: the bright grass never
-- touches the dirt, there's always darker grass between. Replaces World2's copied base
